    {
      "id": 181097,
      "name": "phantaskippy",
      "username": "phantaskippy",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-08-13T22:07:14.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>He's a fantastic way to make the match easier. &nbsp;He hits hard (remember Greazer always deals +1 to the target of his contract) but doesn't hurt your chance to win much.</p><p>The best way to make him a more serious threat is to not have plague rat in the game, and to try and keep his target alive.</p><p>The thinkg I like best about him is his incap is easily one of the harsher ones in the game, and so letting him take out his target early doesn't give you a whole lot of relief.</p>",
      "post_number": 13,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:05:46.234Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
