      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>He&#39;s a fantastic way to make the match easier. &nbsp;He hits hard (remember Greazer always deals +1 to the target of his contract) but doesn&#39;t hurt your chance to win much.</p><p>The best way to make him a more serious threat is to not have plague rat in the game, and to try and keep his target alive.</p><p>The thinkg I like best about him is his incap is easily one of the harsher ones in the game, and so letting him take out his target early doesn&#39;t give you a whole lot of relief.</p>",
